    {
     "e": "🥤",
     "t": "Now fill a dry glass with ice and cold water. Wait 5 minutes."
    },
    {
     "e": "👆",
     "t": "Touch the outside of the glass. Is it wet? Where did the water come from?"
    }
   ],
   "result": "The ice in the warm place melts first. Water drops appear on the outside of the cold glass.",
   "why": "Heating melts the solid ice into liquid water. Water vapour in the air cools on the cold glass and condenses into drops."
